The Corrupt Heart is the final boss, found at the end of [[Act 4]].

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|Corrupt Heart}}
Always starts with {{Int|Corrupt Heart|Debilitate}}. Uses {{Int|Corrupt Heart|Buff}} every 3 turns starting from turn 4.

On all other turns it has a 50/50 chance to use either {{Int|Corrupt Heart|Blood Shots}} followed by {{Int|Corrupt Heart|Echo}} or {{Int|Corrupt Heart|Echo}} followed by {{Int|Corrupt Heart|Blood Shots}}

== Trivia ==
* {{C|Mental Fortress}} activates before {{KW|Beat of Death}} for every {{KW|Stance}} changing card, except for {{C|Indignation}} which activates after.

